# The mini x64 image, for 128 MB of flash, on the production profile and OpenRC: the minimal image, the management
# daemon and API and SSH, busybox as the command set; no container engine, MQTT, operator tools or web console. The
# mini board's basic product and its only one: it has no other variant. A demonstration of the smallest image and
# the template a new small board starts from.
PROFILE=prod
INIT=openrc
FEATURES="micad ssh"
COMPONENTS=""
